 icon="icon mobile"  RT Theme has been designed to fit the screens of all popular devices such as tablets, smart phones and regular computers. You can test it by resizing your browser window. Also, it is carefully developed to look sharp with new generation HiDPI /Retina devices.    /pane  pane title="Styling Tools" icon="icon brush"  With extended styling options of RT Theme you are able to create totally different look for each content section. Please note that all parts of the theme can be re styled without editing core files. Everything you need is inside the theme options. /pane  pane title=" Product Showcase &amp; Portfolio Features" icon="icon th list"  This is a built in (plugin free) product catalog page. You can show your products easily by using powerful tools if you don’t need to online shopping features. It also can be used for service presentations such as tour itineraries, events even hotel presentations. The tabs and their icons and order where inside the products are totally customizable! By using Portfolio custom post types; you can show your portfolio items easily by using the Template Builder or shortcodes. You can categorize, change layouts and combine with other elements. /pane  pane title="Amazing Theme Options" icon="icon cog alt"  RT Framework offers a rock solid theme back end with tons of useful tools and options.  /pane  /accordion  /rt_column  rt_column layout="three"  blog_carousel id="blog carousel 166114 134887" crop="on" style="plain_carousel" heading="LATEST NEWS" heading_icon="icon doc alt" item_width="1" list_orderby="date" list_order="DESC" max_item="4" categories="" ids="" display_excerpts="on" limit_chars="180"  /rt_column  /rt_columns  /row  footer selector_class="footer 166114"  space_box id="space 166114 163852" height="10"  rt_columns  banner id="banner 166114 1146006" gradient="" border="" text_icon="" text_alignment="left" button_text="Purchase Now" button_icon="icon basket" button_link="#" button_size="big" link_target="