omputers. You can test it by resizing your browser window. Also, it is carefully developed to look sharp with new generation HiDPI /Retina devices.    /pane  pane title="Styling Tools" icon="icon brush"  With extended styling options of RT Theme you are able to create totally different look for each content section. Please note that all parts of the theme can be re styled without editing core files. Everything you need is inside the theme options. /pane  pane title=" Product Showcase &amp; Portfolio Features" icon="icon th list"  This is a built in (plugin free) product catalog page. You can show your products easily by using powerful tools if you don’t need to online shopping features. It also can be used for service presentations such as tour itineraries, events even hotel presentations. The tabs and their icons and order where inside the products are totally customizable! By using Portfolio custom post types; you can show your portfolio items easily by using the Template Builder or shortcodes. You can categorize, change layouts and combine with other elements. /pane  pane title="Amazing Theme Options" icon="icon cog alt"  RT Framework offers a rock solid theme back end with tons of useful tools and options. Check the admin panel screenshots to get more idea.. /pane  /accordion  /rt_column  rt_column layout="three"  blog_carousel id="blog carousel 161905 5958" crop="on" style="plain_carousel" heading="LATEST NEWS" heading_icon="icon doc alt" item_width="1" list_orderby="date" list_order="DESC" max_item="4" categories="" ids="" display_excerpts="on" limit_chars=""  /rt_column  /rt_columns  /row  footer selector_class="footer 161905"  space_box id="space 161905 106461" height="20"  rt_columns  banner id="banner 161905 131511" gradient="" border="" text_icon="" text_alignment="left" button_text="Purchase Now" button_icon="icon basket" button_link="http://themeforest.net/item/rttheme 18 responsive wordpress theme/7200532?ref=stmcan" button_size="big" link_target="_self" You can use this module to display a banner box Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Morbi sodales vehicula odio quis lobortis. Aenean lacinia pulvinar hendrerit. /banner  /rt_columns  space_box id="space 161905 2556" height="20"  /footer ', 'yes'),
