(699, 'rttheme18_templateid_829882_content_output', '[row full_width_row="" row_counter=1 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_content" id="row-829882-1" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "" class="row-style-3" css_class="" parallax_background="disabled_parallax" background_image_url = ""][rt_columns][rt_column layout="three"][content_icon_box id="content-box-829882-122107" title="Responsive &amp; Retina Ready" title_position="after" icon="icon-mobile" icon_style="4" text_position="2" icon_color="" icon_bg_color="" icon_border_color="" link="" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>RT-Theme 18 has been designed to fit all screens of all popular devices such as tablets, smart phones and regular computers.</p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][rt_column layout="three"][content_icon_box id="content-box-829882-53378" title="Highly Customizable" title_position="after" icon="icon-magic" icon_style="4" text_position="2" icon_color="" icon_bg_color="" icon_border_color="" link="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/admin-panel/" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>Along with the 8 pre-defined skins,  it is possible to change all colors of every part of the theme with a few clicks by using the extended styling options. </p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][rt_column layout="three"][content_icon_box id="content-box-829882-110102" title="Product Showcase" title_position="after" icon="icon-suitcase" icon_style="4" text_position="2" icon_color="" icon_bg_color="" icon_border_color="" link="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/our-products/" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>Use built-in (plugin free) product catalog page to show your products easily by using powerful tools if you don’t need to online shopping features.</p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=2 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_content" id="row-829882-176710" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "true" class="" 