(715, 'rttheme18_templateid_254857_content_output', '[row full_width_row="" row_counter=1 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_content" id="row-254857-1" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="disabled_parallax" background_image_url = ""][rt_columns][text_box id="text-box-254857-39775"]<p style="text-align: center;">Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem. Morbi imperdiet velit eu arcu <a href="#">consequat</a>, sit amet tristique enim ultricies.</p>[/text_box][/rt_columns][rt_columns][horizontal_line group_id="52831" content_type="horizontal_line" style="4" margin_top="30" margin_bottom="40" ][/rt_columns][rt_columns][rt_column layout="four"][content_icon_box id="content-box-254857-37340" title="Responsive Design" title_position="after" icon="icon-mobile" icon_style="6" text_position="2" icon_color="#ffffff" icon_bg_color="#F4BF1E" icon_border_color="#EEBA1B" link="" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][rt_column layout="four"][content_icon_box id="content-box-254857-599590" title="Highly Customizable" title_position="after" icon="icon-magic" icon_style="6" text_position="2" icon_color="#FFFEFE" icon_bg_color="#70C5E1" icon_border_color="#68B9D4" link="" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][rt_column layout="four"][content_icon_box id="content-box-254857-92745" title="Solid Framework" title_position="after" icon="icon-cog" icon_style="6" text_position="2" icon_color="#FFFEFE" icon_bg_color="#94C8AE" icon_border_color="#85BDA1" link="" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][rt_column layout="four"][content_icon_box id="content-box-254857-2715" title="Extended Documentation" title_position="after" icon="icon-graduation-cap" icon_style="6" text_position="2" icon_color="#FFFEFE" icon_bg_color="#BF9CDD" icon_border_color="#B894D7" link="" link_text="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/content_icon_box][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=2 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_content" id="row-254857-168405" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "true" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="2" background_image_url = "http://192.168.2.225/wp/rt18demo/wp-content/uploads/sites/28/2014/05/splash.jpg"][rt_columns][rt_column layout="two"][v_icon_boxes id="v-icon-box-254857-1100443" icon_align="right"][v_icon_box icon="icon-magic" title="Template Builder" link="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_icon_box][v_icon_box icon="icon-mobile" title="Mobile &amp; Retina Ready" link="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_icon_box][v_icon_box icon="icon-brush" title="Styling Tools" link="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_icon_box][/v_icon_boxes][/rt_column][rt_column layout="two"][v_icon_boxes id="v-icon-box-254857-4226" icon_align="left"][v_icon_box icon="icon-lifebuoy" title="Fast Support" link="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_icon_box][v_icon_box icon="icon-credit-card" title="WooCommerce Shop" link="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_icon_box][v_icon_box icon="icon-suitcase" title="Product Showcase" link="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/our-products/" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_icon_box][/v_icon_boxes][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=3 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_content" id="row-254857-56744" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="disabled_parallax" background_image_url = ""][rt_columns][rt_column layout="two"][heading_bar group_id="108624" content_type="heading_bar" heading="TOP FIVE REASONS TO BUY RT-THEME 18" icon="icon-chart-line" style="" ][tabs tabs_style="vertical" tab1="Template Builder" tab1_icon="icon-magic" tab2="Mobile &amp; Retina Ready" tab2_icon="icon-mobile" tab3="Styling Tools" tab3_icon="icon-brush" tab4=" Product Showcase" tab4_icon="icon-suitcase" tab5="Amazing Theme Options" tab5_icon="icon-cog-alt" ] [tab]<p>Template Builder is a built-in tool that lets you create custom page templates to use with your pages or posts. You are free to edit the default templates or create a new one as you wish. Creating custom templates has never been easy like this!</p>[/tab][tab]<p>RT-Theme 18 has been designed to fit the screens of all popular devices such as tablets, smart phones and regular computers. You can test it by resizing your browser window. Also, it is carefully developed to look sharp with new generation HiDPI /Retina devices.  </p>[/tab][tab]<p>With extended styling options of RT-Theme you are able to create totally different look for each content section. Please note that all parts of the theme can be re-styled without editing core files. Everything you need is inside the theme options.</p>[/tab][tab]<p>This is a built-in (plugin free) product catalog page. You can show your products easily by using powerful tools if you don’t need to online shopping features. It also can be used for service presentations such as tour itineraries, events even hotel presentations. The tabs and their icons and order where inside the <a title="A sample product page with all elements" href="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/product-detail/product-name-9/">products</a> are totally customizable!</p>\r\n<p>By using <a title="a sample page for sortable portfolio page " href="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/our-portfolio-2/">Portfolio</a> custom post types; you can show your portfolio items easily by using the Template Builder or shortcodes. You can categorize, change layouts and combine with other elements.</p>[/tab][tab]<p>RT-Framework offers a rock solid theme back-end with tons of useful tools and options. Check the <a title="Screenshots from theme options panel of RT-Theme 18" href="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/admin-panel/">admin panel screenshots</a> to get more idea..</p>\r\n<p> </p>[/tab][/tabs][/rt_column][rt_column layout="two"][portfolio_carousel id="portfolio-carousel-254857-69719" crop="" style="plain_carousel" heading="Latest Projects" heading_icon="icon-briefcase" item_width="3" list_orderby="date" list_order="DESC" max_item="5" categories="" portfolio_ids="" display_descriptions="" display_titles=""][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row]', 'yes'),
