(731, 'rttheme18_templateid_921038_content_output', '[row full_width_row="" row_counter=1 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_header" id="row-921038-1" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="disabled_parallax" background_image_url = "http://192.168.2.225/wp/rt18demo/wp-content/uploads/sites/28/2014/03/agsquare.png"][rt_columns][h_chained_contents id="v-icon-box-921038-89729" image_style="rounded_image" bw_filter="true" ][h_content image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/photodune-5839302-happy-kid-playing-with-toy-airplane-s.jpg" title="RESPONSIVE DESIGN" link="#" link_target="_self"]<p class="aligncenter">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/h_content][h_content image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/photodune-6670322-typewriter-m.jpg" title="HIGHLY CUSTOMIZABLE" link="#" link_target="_self"]<p class="aligncenter">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/h_content][h_content image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/photodune-3309248-hotair-ballon-s.jpg" title="SOLID FRAMEWORK" link="#" link_target="_self"]<p class="aligncenter">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/h_content][h_content image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/photodune-6904574-chess-s.jpg" title="EXTENDED DOCUMENTATION" link="#" link_target="_self"]<p class="aligncenter">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/h_content][/h_chained_contents][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=2 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_header" id="row-921038-2" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "true" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="2" background_image_url = "http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/photodune-35934.jpg"][rt_columns][rt_column layout="two-three"][v_icon_boxes id="v-icon-box-921038-115927" icon_align="left"][v_icon_box icon="icon-magic" title="Template Builder" link="" link_target="_self"]<div class="toggle-content" style="display: block;">\r\n<p>Template Builder is a built-in tool that lets you create custom page templates to use with your pages or posts. You are free to edit the default templates or create a new one as you wish. Creating custom templates has never been easy like this!</p>\r\n</div>[/v_icon_box][v_icon_box icon="icon-mobile" title="Mobile &amp; Retina Ready" link="" link_target="_self"]<div class="toggle-content" style="display: block;">\r\n<p>RT-Theme has been designed to fit the screens of all popular devices such as tablets, smart phones and regular computers. You can test it by resizing your browser window. Also, it is carefully developed to look sharp with new generation HiDPI /Retina devices.   </p>\r\n</div>[/v_icon_box][v_icon_box icon="icon-brush" title="Styling Tools" link="" link_target="_self"]<div class="toggle-content" style="display: block;">\r\n<p>With extended styling options of RT-Theme you are able to create totally different look for each content section. Please note that all parts of the theme can be re-styled without editing core files. Everything you need is inside the theme options.</p>\r\n</div>[/v_icon_box][/v_icon_boxes][/rt_column][rt_column layout="three"][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=3 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_header" id="row-921038-163500" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="disabled_parallax" background_image_url = ""][rt_columns][product_box id="products-921038-109540" item_width="3" pagination="" list_orderby="date" list_order="DESC" item_per_page="5" categories=""  display_descriptions="on" display_titles="on" display_price="on" heading="LATEST PRODUCTS" with_borders="on" with_effect="on" no_top_border="on" no_bottom_border="on"][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=4 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_header" id="row-921038-50974" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = "true" class="" css_class="" parallax_background="1" background_image_url = "http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/photodune-4558713-fashion-m.jpg"][rt_columns][rt_column layout="two"][v_media_boxes id="v-image-box-921038-5969" image_align="right" image_style="rounded_image" bw_filter="true" ][v_media_box image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/oc6.jpg" title="RESPONSIVE DESIGN" link="" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_media_box][v_media_box image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/oc7.jpg" title="HIGHLY CUSTOMIZABLE" link="#" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus <a href="#">adipiscing</a> aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_media_box][v_media_box image="http://rttheme18.demo-rt.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/oc5.jpg" title="SOLID FRAMEWORK" link="#" link_target="_self"]<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur euismod enim a metus adipiscing aliquam. Vestibulum in vestibulum lorem.</p>[/v_media_box][/v_media_boxes][/rt_column][rt_column layout="two"][/rt_column][/rt_columns][/row][row full_width_row="" row_counter=5 page_title="" breadcrumb="" breadcrumb_position="inside_header" id="row-921038-140618" sidebar_selection = "full" sidebar_id = "" paddings = 